用户要求运镜时必须返回cameraPlans数组，最多6个机位。每项：
{"name":"环绕长镜头","sourceCameraId":"已有机位id，可省略使用当前机位","copyKeyframes":false,"segments":[{"kind":"orbit","durationSeconds":12,"degrees":360,"direction":"clockwise"}]}
